@startuml state-goose
title Goose - State Machine (v2, A1 implementation)
[*] --> Chasing : spawned at a spawn point\nor by GooseNestEvent [FR_GEESE_SPAWN]

state Distracted {
  state Eating
  state Fleeing
}

Chasing --> Eating : fed, still hungry\n[FR_USE_ITEM]
Chasing --> Fleeing : scared\n[FR_USE_ITEM]
Eating --> Fleeing : scared
Fleeing --> Eating : fed, still hungry
Distracted --> Chasing : distraction timer ends
Chasing --> Dispersed : fed, hunger reaches 0\n[FR_GEESE_DISPERSE]
Distracted --> Dispersed : fed, hunger reaches 0
Dispersed --> [*] : removed from map,\ncounted in GameStats

Chasing : walks towards the player;\nslows the player when touching
Eating : stays still for 2.5 s
Fleeing : runs away from the player
@enduml
